{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Need a Lift?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Anytime Elevator and get <strong>LIFTED</strong>, a single player cinematic 2.5D puzzle platform adventure from a former Disney ride designer. <strong>Perfect for Steam Deck.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/98a9f1786cf33d8d3c7413134d6e80df.avif?t=1759138578\" width=1560 height=800 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slacker Ari Buktu only pokes his head into Professor Raventhorpe\u2019s lab for extra credit. Seconds later he is hurtling through history on a reckless mission to steal a legendary tiara and fix the professor\u2019s love life. Each stop opens a new era and a bigger puzzle, with the shadow of a rival tomb raider always one jump behind...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/9f1e590781d36a32ecbad0331c298873.poster.avif?t=1759138578\" width=780 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/9f1e590781d36a32ecbad0331c298873.webm?t=1759138578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/9f1e590781d36a32ecbad0331c298873.mp4?t=1759138578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience pure movie magic in an endearing story about chasing your dreams and being who you are. Chuckle, bond, and grow alongside the characters whenever you\u2019re needing a<i> lift</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a silly and uplifting story written by Austin Film Festival winner, Nick Gambino</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform through ancient Egypt, Mayan civilization, the pirate-filled Tortuga island, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Ari free climb mountainsides or use some of the professor\u2019s handy gadgets to make impossible leaps possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve thoughtfully crafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade some of history\u2019s most notorious trouble makers as they attempt to steal the tiara for themselves</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/584ff6f513395b1747985aea2d22e0bf.poster.avif?t=1759138578\" width=780 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/584ff6f513395b1747985aea2d22e0bf.webm?t=1759138578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/584ff6f513395b1747985aea2d22e0bf.mp4?t=1759138578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184020?t=1759138578","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759138578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/3c80cbc8c31b4a8c353613cc111107ccfe7a3ae6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759138578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/3c80cbc8c31b4a8c353613cc111107ccfe7a3ae6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759138578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"desc